{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Labyrinth is infinite, and it calls to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive headfirst into a new, procedurally generated maze every time you play. These aren't just simple puzzles; they are sprawling, complex worlds of winding corridors and dead ends, stretching up to a massive 7000x5700 in size. Your only goal is to find the exit. But escape is temporary, leading only to another, more daunting challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each descent, you are granted a five-second overview\u2014a fleeting chance to plot your course. Armed with the ability to place markers, you must navigate the twisting paths, collect valuable coins, and race against the clock. As the minutes tick by, the pressure mounts. Can you find the portal before you are lost forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Truly Endless Mazes:</strong>\u00a0With procedural generation, no two runs are ever the same. A new challenge awaits you every single time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive, Sprawling Scale:</strong>\u00a0Navigate colossal mazes that will test your memory and sense of direction to their absolute limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Use the 5-second overview to find a potential path and place markers to track your progress, mark intersections, or signal dead ends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Against the Clock:</strong>\u00a0A persistent timer tracks your performance on each level. The longer you take, the more intense it gets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track Your Progress:</strong>\u00a0A save system automatically records your total mazes completed, coins collected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Experience:</strong>\u00a0A dynamic soundtrack sets the mood for your tense, solitary journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Labyrinth awaits. How many levels can you conquer?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"cb2aff2ed970edb83ed57356ffc84d6c32aa179d.jpg","localized_name":"Good Start","name":"Good Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/704660/cb2aff2ed970edb83ed57356ffc84d6c32aa179d.jpg"},{"icon":"1ef71912a4761b2fee150a64a40f1212aaaa9953.jpg","localized_name":"Warmed Up","name":"Warmed Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/704660/1ef71912a4761b2fee150a64a40f1212aaaa9953.jpg"},{"icon":"18f981639c9b509e63fd84d414ede5950c876891.jpg","localized_name":"More Coins","name":"More Coins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/704660/18f981639c9b509e63fd84d414ede5950c876891.jpg"},{"icon":"781772aa3ddd128c2059976377491c5d7e26ccf6.jpg","localized_name":"Almost There","name":"Almost There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/704660/781772aa3ddd128c2059976377491c5d7e26ccf6.jpg"},{"icon":"6183f74199e1f6a463e7760801651310f50091ab.jpg","localized_name":"All-Star","name":"All-Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/704660/6183f74199e1f6a463e7760801651310f50091ab.jpg"},{"icon":"7934f1ac5555bad04c6bd11d839e08bd017a2fe3.jpg","localized_name":"Coin Finder","name":"Coin Finder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/704660/7934f1ac5555bad04c6bd11d839e08bd017a2fe3.jpg"},{"icon":"1f870a808a2ba698cb301fd206c6f5d317c4463f.jpg","localized_name":"Coin Collector","name":"Coin Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/704660/1f870a808a2ba698cb301fd206c6f5d317c4463f.jpg"},{"icon":"d497d764f38f89ffe7efd66fad0211702e497f7b.jpg","localized_name":"Coin Master","name":"Coin Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/704660/d497d764