ts. Can you find the portal before you are lost forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Truly Endless Mazes:</strong>\u00a0With procedural generation, no two runs are ever the same. A new challenge awaits you every single time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive, Sprawling Scale:</strong>\u00a0Navigate colossal mazes that will test your memory and sense of direction to their absolute limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Use the 5-second overview to find a potential path and place markers to track your progress, mark intersections, or signal dead ends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Against the Clock:</strong>\u00a0A persistent timer tracks your performance on each level. The longer you take, the more intense it gets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track Your Progress:</strong>\u00a0A save system automatically records your total mazes completed, coins collected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Experience:</strong>\u00a0A dynamic soundtrack sets the mood for your tense, solitary journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Labyrinth awaits. How many levels can you conquer?</p>","developers":["JB"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704660/header.jpg?t=1751993425","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/7046